OL,3,GNEWSAMasts from explosives-packed ship
OL,4,Ataken to museum
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree masts removed from a bomb-laden
OL,7,Fshipwreck in the Thames Estuary have
OL,8,Fbeen successfully taken to a maritime
OL,9,Fmuseum.
OL,11,FThe poles, delicately removed from the
OL,12,FSS Richard Montgomery in September,
OL,13,Fwill be kept at the Historic Dockyard
OL,14,FChatham.
OL,16,FThe masts had been visible from the
OL,17,FEssex and Kent coasts since the doomed
OL,18,Fvessel sank with 1,400 tonnes of
OL,19,Fexplosives onboard in 1944.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,322,320,200,140,0,100
